{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview \ud83d\udc40</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the character you drew and try to reach the goal!  \u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character cannot jump, so it cannot climb up a foothold or a wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the character can sleep to stay in place and become a foothold for his friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a character goes to sleep, a new character can be drawn, and the player rides on top of the sleeping character to reach the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the character reaches the flag, the stage is cleared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fewer characters it takes to clear a stage, the higher the score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goodbye Stack graffiti","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3296660/65e97dfc983074141e9b060026777a303b6065c5.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296660?t=1746012649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746012649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296660/05c7433b266efe44d2ff823f36e303547d1a80eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746012649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296660/05c7433b266efe44d2ff823f36e303547d1a80eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746012649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview \ud83d\udc40</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the character you drew and try to reach the goal!  \u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character cannot jump, so it cannot climb up a foothold or a 